WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.500
Meet GrantsCopilot.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.800
The dashboard shows fresh grants,
suggested matches, deadlines,

00:08.800 --> 00:12.200
prep runs, and notification health at a glance.

00:12.800 --> 00:16.500
Opportunities are scored against your Business DNA,
while Data Vault keeps profile details,

00:16.500 --> 00:21.100
team data, and documents ready for reuse.

00:21.600 --> 00:25.800
Choose a grant, then generate eligibility summaries,
checklists, answers,

00:25.800 --> 00:30.250
pitch decks, and supporting documents
from one workspace.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.000
Daily emails keep opportunities visible,
WhatsApp highlights only the strongest matches,

00:35.000 --> 00:39.400
and admin diagnostics show what happened.

00:40.000 --> 00:44.800
GrantsCopilot helps founders move
from search to application-ready faster.
